    "message": "[ipa-delivery:786] build the private test IPA 786: the maintainer's latest fixes on the verified IPA 785\n\n- Base: verified IPA 785.\n- MeloNX: Core 6d8cb068 (pin 4edd1c04), replacing 77a5340d.\n- Switch 2 engine: the thermal follow-up pin 461924b3.\n- Promoted, in history order: the S2Arm lot deferred by 785 (0e9008f0 … 2fd2b660).\n- Reviewed: the 32 first-parent commits since 785 (Nextendo DNS, Switch install, S2Arm and MeloNX fixes).\n- RPCS3 Core 948, Xenia and the other cores are the base's.\n\nChecked here:\n- dart analyze lib on the exported effective tree (Flutter 3.47.2): 0 errors;\n- the delivery contract test (OK, 4 skipped) and the online contract (passed, API authenticated);\n- the freeze: no blocker; trigger paths: accepted.\nNot run here: the Swift and Xcode compile.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
